&oh=00_Af_RD1xk0DE-Jkawna2wR2Y7xuuvoz-COobELoie-NwFkw&oe=6A452695"}, {"file_name": "Interview_01.png", "id": "558098475502894", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_558098478836227_2195642163881727498_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q_POQ3XQLegQ7kNvwEtMkJQ&_nc_oc=AdrQdI4KEmRGf9vaKhJkTg3ipXpVkkwPEVhBMIGCygIvXxHIl2v3e5G_1TDDN2TXDmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bMKFpZldqcyblpugfDb7LU7oFkDyLz4IYi6LSHHHiMQ&oe=6A450ACE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JOb INterview Simulator (4).png", "id": "371985591479423", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035469_371985598146089_1320847157226308449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UaQvILM1O84Q7kNvwGyF6hJ&_nc_oc=Adppwv_HV9MzTHIYz9pI6n58FMpmu4ekz4BWuR62LG5PqXe722BwBaYVYbjW6b_XiUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-zNvRxpi554P0c4H_YdLTj2uZdStMzT7Dv9NJONApcng&oe=6A450A50"}, "display_name": "Job Interview Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Proficient job interviewing craft is vital to attain the careers of our dreams. Unfortunately, it's difficult to practice this skill in a realistic way.\n\nThat's why we built the Job Interview Simulator. Simulate the entire interviewing process; from emailing HR before the interview, picking an outfit, arriving on time, catching the elevator, greeting the receptionist, and acing the interview. \n\nFeel the situational pressure of a Job Interview in an immersive virtual environent, and refine your interviewing craft with automated feedback. \n", "short_description": "Simulate the experience of a Job Interview in Virtual Reality. Practice and hone your interviewing craft in a safe setting, so you can ace your next job interview!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.workwindow.co